# Token Efficiency

## Objective

Achieve quality with **minimal unnecessary context and verbosity**  -  without skipping required research or review.

## Practices

- Grep and targeted reads before full-file dumps.
- Batch parallel tool calls when independent.
- Concise user replies; no essays for simple tasks.
- Do not repeat unchanged context.

